     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Permanent Resolution time: Permanent resolution time refers to the duration it takes for a support team to provide a long-term or permanent solution to a customer's inquiry, issue, or request",
