  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Priority support is a specialized level of assistance offered to customers who seek enhanced responsiveness and expedited resolution of their inquiries or issues. It provides a higher level of priority and personalized attention to ensure a swift and satisfactory resolution.",
